/** 
 * @page VWWxPage VWWx
 *
 * The WxWidgets extension library provides displays (2D and 3D) and user interface elements that use 
 * the WxWidgets widget set. In particular it provides
 *
 * Displays (2D)
 *
 *     - VW::DisplayWxGLWidget : A display widget that must be embedded in a WxWidgets interface
 *
 * Displays (3D)
 *
 *     - VW::ThreeDToolWxGLWidget : A version of the 3D tool which is a WxWidgets widget
 *
 * Interface elements
 *
 *     - VW::SequencerFileWx : A widget to control the VW::SequencerFile
 */
